<title>FRANCE: Algeria launches snap tender for 100,000 T durum.</title>
<headline>Algeria launches snap tender for 100,000 T durum.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria on Tuesday launched a same-day import tender for 100,000 tonnes of durum wheat for shipment in June and July, grain traders said.</p>
<p>The tender is for four equal shipments of optional origin, with two cargoes to be shipped during the second half of June and the rest in the first half of July, they said.</p>
